    "tpb_book": "<ul>\n\t<li>Stanford d.school《Design Thinking Process Guide》《Starter Kit》。</li>\n\t<li>MIT D-Lab（Participatory/Inclusive Design 資源、課程模組）。</li>\n\t<li>Waterloo Institute for Social Innovation and Resilience（WISIR）系統思考/系統創業模組。</li>\n\t<li>USC 公共政策課程（PPD 478 等）之專題導向設計。</li>\n\t<li>Oxford Skoll Centre Impact Lab（影響力領導與職涯）。</li>\n</ul>\n",
